WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:01:04.855 --> 00:01:07.033
"Alexandria".


00:01:23.476 --> 00:01:25.587
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.


00:01:44.789 --> 00:01:47.578
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.


00:02:01.796 --> 00:02:04.852
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.


00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:31.162
Mom, can I keep her stick?


00:02:31.442 --> 00:02:32.992
Yes.


00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.006
Put your belt on, Nelly.


00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:19.694
Did you say goodbye?


00:04:20.202 --> 00:04:21.910
I did.


00:04:42.747 --> 00:04:44.279
Aperitif time?


00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.759
Yes.


00:06:13.952 --> 00:06:15.518
We have arrived.


00:06:26.307 --> 00:06:29.504
- Where's your room?
- It's this one, on the right.


00:07:31.226 --> 00:07:34.566
There's the fridge, if you want
to put it in the cellar.


00:07:35.329 --> 00:07:37.975
Wow I can't move it.


00:07:37.976 --> 00:07:40.433
We shouldn't start here anyway.


00:07:40.434 --> 00:07:42.753
- Hi.
- Hi.


00:07:55.026 --> 00:07:57.196
Where did you make your hut, mom?


00:07:58.656 --> 00:08:00.251
In the woods,
just behind the house.


00:08:00.252 --> 00:08:03.222
- Will you show it to me?
- I have work to do here.


00:08:06.604 --> 00:08:08.885
There are three or four trees?


00:08:09.007 --> 00:08:10.644
Four.


00:08:10.645 --> 00:08:12.464
Like a square.


00:08:13.103 --> 00:08:14.518
Yes.


00:08:17.379 --> 00:08:19.165
I want to build one too.


00:08:19.166 --> 00:08:21.037
Which hut?


00:08:21.038 --> 00:08:23.367
Mom's hut when
she was a little girl.


00:08:23.942 --> 00:08:26.373
That's useless.
He forgot about it.


00:08:32.657 --> 00:08:35.091
We painted the wall
around this cupboard.


00:08:35.762 --> 00:08:37.778
Do you remember that, Marion?


00:08:39.238 --> 00:08:40.711
I remember.


00:08:51.962 --> 00:08:53.497
I'm going out.


00:11:02.497 --> 00:11:03.915
What's that?


00:11:03.916 --> 00:11:05.794
My stuff when I was a kid.


00:11:05.795 --> 00:11:07.508
She kept everything.


00:11:12.905 --> 00:11:15.355
You weren't very good at spelling.


00:11:20.339 --> 00:11:23.420
- You were a good drawer.
- You think so?


00:11:26.454 --> 00:11:29.165
Look at this smoking fox,
it's well drawn.


00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:31.839
Yeah, it's looking good.


00:11:35.912 --> 00:11:38.666
I'm depressed just having
to bring all this home.


00:12:12.549 --> 00:12:14.647
I went into the woods too.


00:12:17.103 --> 00:12:18.721
Time to go to bed.


00:12:31.566 --> 00:12:33.605
Does it hurt you to be here?


00:12:34.359 --> 00:12:36.460
I liked that room.


00:12:36.918 --> 00:12:38.778
But I didn't like it at night.


00:12:38.779 --> 00:12:41.480
- Why?
- Children's matter.


00:12:42.131 --> 00:12:44.489
I'm a child, I'm interested.


00:12:44.784 --> 00:12:47.393
It's bedtime for all children.


00:12:48.275 --> 00:12:51.102
You always ask questions
when you have to go to bed.


00:12:51.103 --> 00:12:53.188
That's when I can see you.


00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:10.911
You have to wait.


00:13:11.191 --> 00:13:12.739
Wait for what?


00:13:13.306 --> 00:13:15.861
Wait for your eyes to
get used to the darkness.


00:13:17.068 --> 00:13:18.822
That's when it appears.


00:13:19.462 --> 00:13:21.251
The black panther.


00:13:21.252 --> 00:13:23.063
At the end of your bed.


00:13:27.022 --> 00:13:29.925
I could hear its heart
beating in my pillow.


00:13:29.926 --> 00:13:31.822
Louder and louder.


00:13:31.823 --> 00:13:33.772
But it was just mine.


00:13:41.391 --> 00:13:44.147
- Do you see it?
- No.


00:13:45.728 --> 00:13:47.342
I don't see it either.


00:15:17.693 --> 00:15:19.584
I'm sad too.


00:15:20.612 --> 00:15:22.027
Tell me...


00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:24.089
I didn't say goodbye to her.


00:15:24.867 --> 00:15:26.817
You always said goodbye.


00:15:27.402 --> 00:15:29.817
The last goodbye was not good.


00:15:31.335 --> 00:15:33.592
That's because I couldn't know.


00:15:35.194 --> 00:15:37.410
She couldn't know either.


00:15:37.411 --> 00:15:39.162
We don't know about that.


00:15:39.935 --> 00:15:42.680
You're right.
We don't know.


00:15:49.155 --> 00:15:51.181
How would you have
wanted to say goodbye?


00:15:54.242 --> 00:15:55.973
Goodbye.


00:16:01.146 --> 00:16:02.844
Goodbye.


00:16:41.292 --> 00:16:42.707
Wait.


00:16:52.806 --> 00:16:54.730
I slept in the living room.


00:16:59.912 --> 00:17:02.978
- With mom.
- Yes, she told me about that.


00:17:10.111 --> 00:17:11.688
She's sad.


00:17:14.007 --> 00:17:15.528
I know.


00:17:17.797 --> 00:17:19.980
She decided to leave this morning.


00:17:20.378 --> 00:17:22.470
We thought it would be better.


00:17:29.539 --> 00:17:31.868
- I have a mission for you.
- What mission?


00:17:31.869 --> 00:17:34.022
The cupboard in the hall.


00:17:34.155 --> 00:17:36.655
After that we leave quickly
from here to see her.


00:18:25.603 --> 00:18:28.580
Dad? What's that thing?


00:18:30.437 --> 00:18:32.418
It's a paddleball.


00:18:34.532 --> 00:18:36.605
You hit the ball and it comes back.


00:18:39.474 --> 00:18:41.236
So it's meant to be
played alone.


00:18:41.237 --> 00:18:43.272
Yes, in a way.


00:18:44.532 --> 00:18:46.133
Perfect.


00:20:04.357 --> 00:20:06.124
Will you help me?


00:21:28.804 --> 00:21:30.314
What's your name?


00:21:31.071 --> 00:21:32.486
Marion.


00:21:37.099 --> 00:21:38.514
Come.


00:22:38.128 --> 00:22:39.803
Give me your sweater.


00:23:31.484 --> 00:23:33.279
Do you want something to drink?


00:23:37.399 --> 00:23:38.827
Yes.


00:24:16.213 --> 00:24:17.855
Take a seat.


00:24:25.004 --> 00:24:27.259
You didn't tell me your name.


00:24:27.260 --> 00:24:28.694
Nelly.


00:24:29.432 --> 00:24:31.480
I'd never seen you before.


00:24:31.930 --> 00:24:33.794
I am at my grandmother's house.


00:24:33.795 --> 00:24:35.647
Who's your grandmother?


00:24:36.292 --> 00:24:38.252
She died last week.


00:24:38.253 --> 00:24:40.022
We're emptying the house.


00:25:19.993 --> 00:25:23.272
I like to eat chocolate like that.


00:25:31.774 --> 00:25:34.179
My grandmother died last year.


00:25:35.440 --> 00:25:37.293
She had the same name as you.


00:25:43.888 --> 00:25:46.017
The bathroom is at the
end of the hallway?


00:25:46.018 --> 00:25:47.444
Yes.


00:27:08.814 --> 00:27:10.467
Are you leaving?


00:27:13.090 --> 00:27:14.505
Yes.


00:27:15.796 --> 00:27:17.772
My family must be worried.


00:27:18.534 --> 00:27:20.506
Ok, bye.


00:27:21.197 --> 00:27:22.612
Bye.


00:28:03.199 --> 00:28:04.676
Dad?


00:28:05.295 --> 00:28:06.835
Yeah.


00:28:14.429 --> 00:28:15.957
Are you okay?


00:28:17.081 --> 00:28:19.147
I was afraid you were gone.


00:28:20.036 --> 00:28:21.503
I'm here.


00:28:23.114 --> 00:28:25.592
You put your sweater on backwards.


00:28:25.593 --> 00:28:27.525
Take it off.


00:28:36.430 --> 00:28:37.955
Did you like playing paddleball?


00:28:37.956 --> 00:28:40.647
The elastic broke
and I couldn't find the ball.


00:28:45.876 --> 00:28:48.520
I found the place where
Mom built her hut.


00:28:48.705 --> 00:28:50.850
The trees were just as
she described them.


00:28:51.970 --> 00:28:54.301
Don't you remember it at all?


00:28:54.917 --> 00:28:56.428
No.


00:28:57.003 --> 00:28:59.730
The one she built just
before her operation.


00:29:02.963 --> 00:29:05.826
You didn't really forget,
you just didn't listen to her.


00:29:07.334 --> 00:29:08.797
You're right.


00:29:09.317 --> 00:29:10.686
That's a nice rope.


00:29:10.687 --> 00:29:13.060
I'm glad you like it,
but that's mine!


00:29:13.061 --> 00:29:16.029
- I'm gonna use it to pack the books.
- But it's so long.


00:31:48.240 --> 00:31:49.720
Good.


00:31:51.257 --> 00:31:53.310
I cut here...


00:32:00.826 --> 00:32:03.060
A little more. Hold it.


00:32:33.953 --> 00:32:35.868
How old are you?


00:32:36.591 --> 00:32:38.258
I'm eight. And you?


00:32:38.700 --> 00:32:40.181
The same.


00:32:40.303 --> 00:32:42.159
Any brothers and sisters?


00:32:42.160 --> 00:32:43.785
No. I'd like some.


00:32:43.786 --> 00:32:45.372
Me too.


00:32:52.995 --> 00:32:54.710
Are you thirsty?


00:33:03.891 --> 00:33:06.239
How long are you staying here?


00:33:07.130 --> 00:33:10.628
I don't know.
The time it takes to clear the house.


00:33:10.629 --> 00:33:12.844
We could do stuff together.


00:33:12.984 --> 00:33:14.968
I have to go home now.


00:33:14.969 --> 00:33:16.479
Ok.


00:33:17.482 --> 00:33:19.337
What are you going to do?


00:33:19.338 --> 00:33:21.054
I don't know.


00:33:21.221 --> 00:33:23.136
Want to come with me?


00:33:34.690 --> 00:33:37.220
- What colour do you want?
- Blue.


00:33:41.529 --> 00:33:43.095
Ten.


00:33:45.402 --> 00:33:46.845
Three.


00:33:49.403 --> 00:33:50.818
Six.


00:33:54.648 --> 00:33:56.975
"Each player picks a goose."


00:33:56.976 --> 00:33:58.591
Where's the six?


00:33:59.526 --> 00:34:02.618
You skip a turn, I play twice...


00:34:03.010 --> 00:34:04.098
Five.


00:34:04.099 --> 00:34:06.514
One, two, three, four, five.


00:34:09.104 --> 00:34:10.519
Eight.


00:34:10.833 --> 00:34:14.562
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.


00:34:15.829 --> 00:34:16.893
Six.


00:34:16.894 --> 00:34:19.391
One, two, three, four, five, six.


00:34:19.392 --> 00:34:20.524
Hi!


00:34:20.525 --> 00:34:24.466
"You're in the dungeon.
Back to square one."


00:34:24.467 --> 00:34:25.901
No!


00:34:28.883 --> 00:34:30.574
Hello.


00:34:32.713 --> 00:34:34.195
Hello, ma'am.


00:34:35.383 --> 00:34:37.199
Did you go out, Marion?


00:34:38.296 --> 00:34:39.882
I was careful.


00:34:40.592 --> 00:34:44.058
The doctor will tell you again later.
He's less patient than me.


00:34:44.389 --> 00:34:46.141
We won't tell him.


00:34:55.711 --> 00:34:57.664
We leave in an hour.


00:35:11.624 --> 00:35:13.915
I'm having an operation soon.


00:35:17.340 --> 00:35:18.784
Ok.


00:35:19.854 --> 00:35:23.938
If they don't do it now, I'll have
my mom's problem when I grow up.


00:35:25.119 --> 00:35:26.897
When's the operation?


00:35:27.262 --> 00:35:28.949
In three days.


00:36:02.061 --> 00:36:04.143
What's up?
You look miles away.


00:36:04.385 --> 00:36:06.514
I think I've made a new friend.


00:36:07.367 --> 00:36:09.594
Do you mind if I smoke?


00:36:09.595 --> 00:36:11.324
It's bad for you, but go on.


00:36:11.633 --> 00:36:13.124
Thanks.


00:36:23.903 --> 00:36:26.452
Can I sleep at her place?


00:36:26.453 --> 00:36:28.036
When?


00:36:28.037 --> 00:36:30.230
I don't know,
she didn't invite me yet.


00:36:32.485 --> 00:36:34.963
We are still here
for two or three days.


00:36:36.608 --> 00:36:39.300
You're allowed to sleep
at her place if she invites you.


00:36:39.608 --> 00:36:41.833
But don't go there uninvited.


00:36:44.836 --> 00:36:47.191
Did Mom's operation go well?


00:36:47.579 --> 00:36:49.385
She told you about it, didn't she?


00:36:49.731 --> 00:36:51.938
Yes, but she may not
have told everything.


00:36:55.313 --> 00:36:57.938
We never talk about your childhood.


00:36:58.101 --> 00:37:00.433
We talk about that all the time.


00:37:01.788 --> 00:37:04.245
Yes, but that's just short stories.


00:37:04.420 --> 00:37:06.627
What do you mean by that?


00:37:06.628 --> 00:37:10.156
I know every Christmas present you had,
or the fact that you loved pizza...


00:37:10.675 --> 00:37:12.730
I don't know about the real things.


00:37:13.646 --> 00:37:15.652
What do you mean by "real things"?


00:37:15.827 --> 00:37:18.025
The things you were afraid of,
for example.


00:37:18.722 --> 00:37:21.347
I was afraid of many things
like everyone else.


00:37:22.342 --> 00:37:24.104
Tell me about one thing.


00:37:33.822 --> 00:37:35.702
Have you forgotten?


00:37:37.030 --> 00:37:39.272
No, I have not.


00:37:45.677 --> 00:37:47.911
I was afraid of my father.


00:39:01.397 --> 00:39:02.964
How will you die?


00:39:03.144 --> 00:39:04.899
Stabbed in my sleep.


00:39:04.900 --> 00:39:06.594
And why will you be killed?


00:39:06.851 --> 00:39:08.131
For the money.


00:39:08.132 --> 00:39:11.480
I come from United States but I
own a Coca Cola factory in France.


00:39:12.302 --> 00:39:13.951
So you're very rich.


00:39:14.720 --> 00:39:16.416
I'm fine, yes.


00:39:16.546 --> 00:39:18.925
Then again, there's the crisis.


00:39:19.910 --> 00:39:21.518
Okay, so who else would
you want to be?


00:39:21.519 --> 00:39:23.078
The Inspector.


00:39:23.505 --> 00:39:25.980
I'm going to be the Countess.


00:39:27.853 --> 00:39:29.627
So you also play...


00:39:29.628 --> 00:39:31.836
the Countess's son,


00:39:32.997 --> 00:39:34.570
and the maid.


00:39:36.072 --> 00:39:38.791
I'll also play the Inspector's wife.


00:39:40.153 --> 00:39:42.153
And the reporter.


00:39:42.282 --> 00:39:46.091
No, otherwise there will be no scene
between the reporter and the countess.


00:39:55.097 --> 00:39:57.123
I play more characters than you.


00:39:57.124 --> 00:39:59.338
It's fine, because I have a big role.


00:40:56.771 --> 00:40:58.980
Could you help me with the tie?


00:41:00.258 --> 00:41:01.809
Of course.


00:41:02.664 --> 00:41:04.142
Come here.


00:41:34.793 --> 00:41:36.248
There you go.


00:41:38.441 --> 00:41:39.924
Thanks.


00:41:47.744 --> 00:41:49.235
"Bulb".


00:41:49.619 --> 00:41:51.042
Where?


00:41:51.043 --> 00:41:52.585
Here.


00:42:06.260 --> 00:42:08.458
So here it's...


00:42:09.474 --> 00:42:11.063
"Ablution".


00:42:27.967 --> 00:42:29.918
Here, there's "zone".


00:42:31.354 --> 00:42:33.295
You're quite good at your age.


00:42:51.282 --> 00:42:53.438
Would you give me
that glass of water?


00:42:57.956 --> 00:42:59.906
Thanks Nelly.


00:43:04.258 --> 00:43:06.898
It's been a long time
since I've said that name.


00:43:12.148 --> 00:43:14.494
I went to bed at 9.


00:43:14.668 --> 00:43:16.381
It was still daylight.


00:43:16.382 --> 00:43:18.082
And when I woke up.


00:43:18.083 --> 00:43:20.835
He was lying dead next to me.


00:43:20.836 --> 00:43:23.397
He died between 3 AM and 6 AM.


00:43:23.967 --> 00:43:26.455
So, did you really not
notice anything wrong?


00:43:26.456 --> 00:43:28.395
He was quite worried lately.


00:43:28.396 --> 00:43:30.661
He was facing problems at the factory.


00:43:30.662 --> 00:43:32.214
What kind of problems?


00:43:32.215 --> 00:43:34.423
I don't know, he was secretive.


00:43:34.566 --> 00:43:35.815
What about you?


00:43:35.816 --> 00:43:37.231
Me?


00:43:37.686 --> 00:43:39.333
Are you secretive?


00:43:40.699 --> 00:43:42.145
You know... A secret...


00:43:42.146 --> 00:43:44.692
It's not necessarily
a thing you want to hide.


00:43:44.693 --> 00:43:47.188
It's just that you don't
have anyone to tell them to.


00:43:48.459 --> 00:43:49.994
I'm listening.


00:43:51.996 --> 00:43:53.455
You play very well!


00:43:53.456 --> 00:43:54.871
You too.


00:43:55.086 --> 00:43:57.230
I would like to be an actress.


00:43:58.563 --> 00:44:00.027
Really?


00:44:01.126 --> 00:44:02.417
Yes.


00:44:02.418 --> 00:44:03.847
It's my dream.


00:44:05.671 --> 00:44:07.221
You could become one.


00:44:07.555 --> 00:44:09.897
- You think so?
- Yes.


00:44:16.432 --> 00:44:20.888
I'm tired of staying inside.
Can't we go to your place?


00:44:20.889 --> 00:44:22.910
Not possible.


00:44:22.911 --> 00:44:24.327
Why?


00:44:24.559 --> 00:44:26.068
A bad atmosphere.


00:44:27.188 --> 00:44:29.128
That's because of your grandmother?


00:44:29.825 --> 00:44:31.242
No.


00:44:31.398 --> 00:44:32.998
My mom left.


00:44:32.999 --> 00:44:34.413
Why?


00:44:34.414 --> 00:44:35.853
Dunno.


00:44:38.606 --> 00:44:40.907
I'm sure she'll come back.


00:44:42.715 --> 00:44:44.923
Are you afraid for the operation?


00:44:45.622 --> 00:44:47.061
Yes.


00:44:49.702 --> 00:44:51.266
Ask her if you can come


00:44:51.267 --> 00:44:53.474
to my place,
but meet me in the hut.


00:44:58.838 --> 00:45:01.813
I'm glad we've met.


00:45:21.950 --> 00:45:23.405
Are you okay?


00:45:26.103 --> 00:45:28.510
I've decided to make one
of your dreams come true.


00:45:29.075 --> 00:45:30.503
Which one?


00:45:31.302 --> 00:45:34.158
- Well, guess.
- Cutting your beard.


00:45:43.947 --> 00:45:47.022
This old school stuff is cool,
I wanted to try it.


00:45:53.264 --> 00:45:54.855
Close your mouth.


00:46:43.110 --> 00:46:44.826
Hi.


00:46:51.166 --> 00:46:52.864
You're handsome.


00:46:52.865 --> 00:46:54.340
Thank you.


00:46:56.606 --> 00:46:59.506
- Are these the books you want to keep?
- Yes.


00:47:00.896 --> 00:47:03.546
- You want me to read you one tonight?
- No.


00:47:03.851 --> 00:47:06.132
I want to sleep because
I can't wait tomorrow.


00:47:06.541 --> 00:47:09.338
So we activate the time acceleration?


00:47:12.530 --> 00:47:13.643
Ready?


00:47:13.644 --> 00:47:15.059
Ready.


00:47:36.077 --> 00:47:38.955
Thanks, it's better
than I imagined.


00:47:40.851 --> 00:47:42.286
Marion?


00:47:48.322 --> 00:47:50.111
I have a secret.


00:47:50.112 --> 00:47:51.813
Well, it's not only mine.


00:47:52.521 --> 00:47:54.222
I'll tell you too.


00:47:54.798 --> 00:47:56.907
You have to know it.


00:47:57.597 --> 00:47:59.469
What's going on?


00:48:01.853 --> 00:48:04.315
Promise me you'll believe me.


00:48:07.347 --> 00:48:09.133
I'll believe you.


00:48:13.088 --> 00:48:15.027
I'm your child.


00:48:16.307 --> 00:48:17.923
I'm your daughter.


00:48:25.242 --> 00:48:27.570
So you come from the future?


00:48:29.927 --> 00:48:32.360
I come from this path behind you.


00:48:36.831 --> 00:48:38.637
Show me.


00:50:35.865 --> 00:50:37.833
How old am I?


00:50:38.905 --> 00:50:40.490
31.


00:50:43.267 --> 00:50:45.387
She dies when I'm 31.


00:50:46.010 --> 00:50:47.472
That's old.


00:50:49.208 --> 00:50:50.956
Not that old.


00:50:51.932 --> 00:50:54.699
She always talks about it
as if it were tomorrow.


00:50:55.554 --> 00:50:57.318
Always.


00:50:59.947 --> 00:51:01.536
She said...


00:51:01.699 --> 00:51:04.222
"This may be the last time
we see each other."


00:51:05.618 --> 00:51:07.521
She already says that.


00:51:11.769 --> 00:51:14.102
Have you kept her stick?


00:51:14.103 --> 00:51:15.518
Yes.


00:51:21.626 --> 00:51:23.489
It smells like her hand.


00:51:26.911 --> 00:51:28.954
You liked her a lot.


00:51:31.005 --> 00:51:32.916
Yes, very much.


00:51:38.253 --> 00:51:39.585
Nelly?


00:51:39.586 --> 00:51:41.391
That's my father.


00:51:43.003 --> 00:51:44.605
Nelly?


00:51:45.104 --> 00:51:46.862
What are we going to do?


00:51:48.314 --> 00:51:49.948
Go.


00:51:55.697 --> 00:51:57.760
It's done.


00:51:58.494 --> 00:52:00.701
We take our stuff and we can leave.


00:52:01.407 --> 00:52:02.994
I thought we were leaving tomorrow.


00:52:02.995 --> 00:52:05.467
I thought that too but
I worked hard.


00:52:05.813 --> 00:52:08.135
Can't we leave tomorrow morning?


00:52:08.284 --> 00:52:11.562
Today's Mom's birthday.
It will be a nice surprise for her.


00:52:12.867 --> 00:52:14.605
I don't understand you Nelly.


00:52:14.606 --> 00:52:16.392
Aren't you eager to see her again?


00:52:16.393 --> 00:52:19.350
- Yes, I am.
- So what's the problem then?


00:52:19.778 --> 00:52:21.934
I wanted to stay one more night.


00:52:22.501 --> 00:52:24.249
Are you leaving?


00:52:27.700 --> 00:52:29.115
Yes.


00:52:29.653 --> 00:52:31.183
Hello.


00:52:31.184 --> 00:52:32.737
Hello.


00:52:33.662 --> 00:52:37.115
I wanted to invite Nelly to
sleep at my place tonight.


00:52:37.365 --> 00:52:39.255
See? I've been invited.


00:52:39.490 --> 00:52:40.998
I see.


00:52:42.211 --> 00:52:44.049
Why are you leaving now?


00:52:44.050 --> 00:52:45.970
I'm going to get back to Mom.


00:52:46.659 --> 00:52:49.259
It's a shame, we were
going to make pancakes.


00:52:49.260 --> 00:52:51.076
Yes it's a shame.


00:52:52.708 --> 00:52:54.532
Another time.


00:53:07.949 --> 00:53:10.647
There won't be another time.


00:53:29.876 --> 00:53:31.871
Thank you.


00:53:59.751 --> 00:54:02.300
You've put way too much milk in it.


00:54:03.171 --> 00:54:04.672
It's fine.


00:54:04.673 --> 00:54:06.053
No it's not.


00:54:06.054 --> 00:54:07.777
It's not fine.


00:54:07.778 --> 00:54:10.402
Wait, wait, wait...


00:54:39.889 --> 00:54:42.713
You've got half a mustache.


00:54:59.267 --> 00:55:01.108
Come in.


00:55:08.458 --> 00:55:09.906
You're late.


00:55:09.907 --> 00:55:11.444
Sorry.


00:55:11.445 --> 00:55:13.735
When was the last time?


00:55:15.273 --> 00:55:17.088
One year ago.


00:55:19.941 --> 00:55:21.840
Are you hurt?


00:55:27.968 --> 00:55:29.659
An accident.


00:55:30.168 --> 00:55:32.838
You're hopeless, Inspector.


00:55:36.340 --> 00:55:38.272
I wanted to see you again.


00:55:38.273 --> 00:55:40.454
I wanted to see you again too.


00:55:40.824 --> 00:55:44.059
- Why?
- You know very well.


00:55:44.162 --> 00:55:45.944
Tell me anyway.


00:55:45.945 --> 00:55:47.735
Because I love you.


00:55:49.892 --> 00:55:52.355
Come away with me.


00:55:54.204 --> 00:55:56.048
This won't be possible.


00:55:57.378 --> 00:56:00.630
I have family in New York,
we could start over.


00:56:01.218 --> 00:56:04.582
Don't you want to know
why I've brought you here?


00:56:04.583 --> 00:56:05.998
Yes.


00:56:25.536 --> 00:56:27.827
Shh, shh, it's okay.


00:56:29.880 --> 00:56:31.769
This is our baby.


00:56:33.218 --> 00:56:35.369
He's beautiful.


00:56:41.411 --> 00:56:44.255
This is why I can't leave.


00:56:49.001 --> 00:56:50.711
He looks like you.


00:58:02.751 --> 00:58:04.512
Come on girls.


00:58:06.934 --> 00:58:09.916
First the soup, then the party.


00:58:52.059 --> 00:58:56.388
<i>Happy birthday to you...</i>


00:58:56.389 --> 00:59:00.886
<i>Happy birthday to you...</i>


00:59:00.887 --> 00:59:06.410
<i>Happy birthday to you Marion...</i>


00:59:06.411 --> 00:59:11.302
<i>Happy birthday to you.</i>


00:59:16.659 --> 00:59:18.083
One more time.


00:59:20.021 --> 00:59:24.153
<i>Happy birthday to you...</i>


00:59:24.154 --> 00:59:28.211
<i>Happy birthday to you...</i>


00:59:28.212 --> 00:59:33.291
<i>Happy birthday to you Marion...</i>


00:59:33.292 --> 00:59:38.522
<i>Happy birthday to you...</i>


00:59:47.349 --> 00:59:49.420
Why did she leave?


00:59:53.396 --> 00:59:54.811
Your mom.


00:59:56.072 --> 00:59:57.829
She didn't tell me.


01:00:01.022 --> 01:00:03.246
What did your dad say?


01:00:04.092 --> 01:00:05.659
He doesn't say much.


01:00:06.126 --> 01:00:07.778
But he's sad.


01:00:12.215 --> 01:00:13.751
I feel like...


01:00:14.300 --> 01:00:16.840
everyone has questions.


01:00:18.177 --> 01:00:19.686
You too?


01:00:20.787 --> 01:00:22.202
Yes.


01:00:25.206 --> 01:00:27.292
You were young when you had me.


01:00:28.311 --> 01:00:29.726
And?


01:00:33.536 --> 01:00:34.990
I don't know.


01:00:35.412 --> 01:00:37.340
That's what you're telling to me.


01:00:37.450 --> 01:00:39.306
So, I'm listening.


01:00:41.851 --> 01:00:43.436
When?


01:00:44.050 --> 01:00:45.617
23.


01:00:47.521 --> 01:00:49.273
Did I want to have you?


01:00:51.012 --> 01:00:52.427
Yes.


01:00:56.889 --> 01:00:58.744
I'm not surprised.


01:00:59.809 --> 01:01:02.173
Because I'm already
thinking of you.


01:02:22.592 --> 01:02:24.194
What time is it?


01:02:24.195 --> 01:02:25.617
7 AM.


01:02:33.362 --> 01:02:35.649
When do you go to the hospital?


01:02:35.650 --> 01:02:37.217
At 12.


01:02:50.211 --> 01:02:52.873
We have time
to do one last thing together.


01:02:57.673 --> 01:02:59.711
Is it music from the future?


01:03:00.144 --> 01:03:01.603
Yes.


01:03:04.443 --> 01:03:06.201
Let me hear it.


01:06:04.233 --> 01:06:06.695
Should I take some games?


01:06:06.857 --> 01:06:08.891
They must have some there.


01:06:09.480 --> 01:06:12.150
But will there be other
children to play with?


01:06:13.300 --> 01:06:14.715
Take them.


01:06:29.275 --> 01:06:31.090
Are you afraid?


01:06:31.255 --> 01:06:32.802
Afraid of what?


01:06:33.262 --> 01:06:35.353
Afraid I won't come back.


01:06:38.166 --> 01:06:40.262
Everything will be fine.


01:06:40.963 --> 01:06:42.946
I'm talking about the future.


01:06:42.947 --> 01:06:44.799
I'm talking about your mom.


01:06:45.570 --> 01:06:47.162
Yes a bit.


01:06:48.034 --> 01:06:49.557
Why?


01:06:53.584 --> 01:06:55.883
Because you're often unhappy.


01:06:56.229 --> 01:06:58.590
You're not often happy to be here.


01:07:02.515 --> 01:07:05.055
I think it's not your fault.


01:07:06.013 --> 01:07:07.587
Do you think so?


01:07:08.470 --> 01:07:10.313
Sometimes I think that.


01:07:17.068 --> 01:07:19.559
You didn't make me sad.


01:08:00.463 --> 01:08:03.391
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.


01:09:23.702 --> 01:09:25.505
Sorry.


01:09:26.035 --> 01:09:27.981
For what?


01:09:28.870 --> 01:09:30.571
I left you here.


01:09:31.714 --> 01:09:33.438
Don't be sorry.


01:09:34.018 --> 01:09:35.645
It was nice.


01:09:46.818 --> 01:09:49.286
I wanted to see the place
one last time.


01:09:59.362 --> 01:10:02.333
- It feels weird.
- Yes.


01:10:12.220 --> 01:10:13.820
Marion?


01:10:21.999 --> 01:10:23.490
Nelly.

